    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have you ever wished you were a ninja when you were climbing a mountain with a pickaxe or jumping to save a princess? Of course, I have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201dJUMPING JUMP NINJA&quot; is a super-high difficulty action game in which you jump over every obstacle with ninja leaps and wall kicks! Adjust your strength and position to run up buildings and cliffs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach the top, you will be a true ninja.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful. If you climbed up with a lot of energy, it means you will fall down in a single bound.</p>",
